<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA V AUSTRALIA TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA V AUSTRALIA TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the second day of</p>
<p>the one-off test match between India and Australia on Friday:</p>
<p>Australia first innings 182 (A.Kumble 4-63)</p>
<p>India first innings (overnight 57-1)</p>
<p> V.Rathore c Ponting b Reiffel	  5</p>
<p> N.Mongia not out			 137</p>
<p> S.Ganguly c M.Waugh b Hogg	    66</p>
<p> S.Tendulkar c M.Waugh b McIntyre    10</p>
<p> M.Azharuddin b McGrath		  17</p>
<p> R.Dravid c Healy b S.Waugh	    40</p>
<p> S.Joshi c Ponting b McIntyre	  23</p>
<p> A.Kapoor not out			   8</p>
<p> Extras (b-5 lb-1 nb-7)		  13</p>
<p> Total (for six wickets)		319</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-13 2-144 3-169 4-199 5-260 6-303</p>
<p>To bat: A.Kumble, V.Prasad, D.Johnson.</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): McGrath 23-9-43-1 (5nb), Reiffel</p>
<p>14-5-34-1, S.Waugh 13-5-25-1 (1nb), McIntyre 34-6-100-2, Hogg</p>
<p>17-3-69-1 (1nb), M.Waugh 12-0-42-0</p>
</text>
